    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27250" root="طوح" body-key="T">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطَاوُحٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>casting,</i> or <i>throwing,</i> a
thing [<i>to and fro,</i>] <i>one with another;</i> or <i>one to,</i> or
<i>at, another.</i> (KL.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطَاوَحَتْ بِهِمُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَّوَى</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَامَتٌ</span> [i. e. (assumed tropical:)  <i>Distance cast them
away, one from another</i>]. (S, A, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطَاوَحُوهُ بِالضَّرْبِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالأَمْرِ</span>, <i>They contended with
him</i> [<i>in beating,</i> and <i>in the affair</i>]. (A.)

